{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wudi-e-o183a","title":"呼厨泉来朝留魏，去卑监国","accounts":[{"id":"wudi-e-o183a-account","label":"正文","text":"呼厨泉率名王来朝，以客礼接待并留魏，去卑受命监其国。","evidence":["wudi-e-o183a-q"]},{"id":"wuhuan-a-da4d15b9a252fbe0f35c","label":"正文","text":"呼厨泉南单于入朝，遂留内侍，右贤王受命代抚其国","evidence":["wuhuan-q-5da8a1d250f1cd3d8952"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wudi-p0357","role":"来朝留魏","evidence":["wudi-e-o183a-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0358","role":"监国","evidence":["wudi-e-o183a-q"]},{"person":"cao-cao","role":"接待任命","evidence":["wudi-e-o183a-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"建安二十一年秋七月","year":216,"precision":"year","basis":"纪年经本批逐段审定；年份依据见所引原文纪年与现代注释。","evidence":["wudi-e-o183a-q","wudi-q-o181","wudi-q-b-ffe7e713612c244b7681"],"chronology":"wudi-y216","dating_review":{"anchor":"wudi-q-o181","basis":"建安二十一年秋七月","reviewed":true}},"source_order":[1,1036,"O183a"],"order":391}],"persons":[{"id":"wudi-p0358","name":"去卑","evidence":["wudi-q-o183","wgc-q0039","wuhuan-q-5da8a1d250f1cd3d8952"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"wudi-m-o183-wudi-p0358","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["wudi-q-o183"]},{"id":"wgc-m-o050-wudi-p0358","kind":"mention","text":"本段涉及去卑","evidence":["wgc-q0039"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"wgc-q0039","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-d693a552b14d342eae71","layer":"original","quote":"后迁城阳太守〖5〗。是时并州（右）〔左〕贤王刘豹并为一部〖6〗。艾上言曰：“戎狄兽心，不以义亲；强则侵暴，弱则内附。故周宣有狁之寇〖7〗，汉祖有平城之围〖8〗；每匈奴一盛，为前代重患。自单于在外〖9〗，莫能牵制长卑〖10〗；诱而致之，使来入侍〖11〗。由是羌夷失统〖12〗，合散无主；以单于在内，万里顺轨〖13〗。今单于之尊日疏，外土之威浸重〖14〗，则胡虏不可不深备也。闻刘豹部有叛胡，可因叛，割为二国，以分其势。去卑功显前朝〖15〗，而子不继业；宜加其子显号〖16〗，使居雁门。离国弱寇〖17〗，追录旧勋，此御边长计也。”","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":264,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":263},{"id":"wudi-e-o183a-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-83f7b9d702d089d8a771","layer":"original","quote":"秋七月，匈奴南单于呼厨泉，将其名王来朝。待以客礼，遂留魏。使右贤王去卑监其国〖5〗。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":360,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":42},{"id":"wudi-q-b-ffe7e713612c244b7681","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-ffe7e713612c244b7681","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗二十一年：建安二十一年（公元 216）。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":363,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-6fbf1801762e86de3cad","start":0,"end":23},{"id":"wudi-q-o181","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-13ff126a9ae1c811de3d","layer":"original","quote":"二十一年春二月〖1〗，公还邺。﹝一﹞三月壬寅〖2〗，公亲耕籍田。﹝二﹞","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":358,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":35},{"id":"wudi-q-o183","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-83f7b9d702d089d8a771","layer":"original","quote":"秋七月，匈奴南单于呼厨泉，将其名王来朝。待以客礼，遂留魏。使右贤王去卑监其国〖5〗。八月，以大理钟繇为相国〖6〗。﹝四﹞","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":360,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":60},{"id":"wuhuan-q-5da8a1d250f1cd3d8952","section":"chapter-030","block":"b-b00cc970e1a8caac9059","layer":"original","quote":"建安中，呼厨泉南单于入朝，遂留内侍，使右贤王抚其国","section_title":"乌丸鲜卑东夷传第三十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0066.xhtml","index":2,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":25}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
